source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§3.2, pp. 59–60; Theorem 3.8, pp. 64–65; scans 67–68, 72–73"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"4"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e1b2071b23104400\" href=\"?note=e1b2071b23104400\" title=\"73-df-dfa-product\">73-df-dfa-product</a> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_1,M_2,B,\\delta_{\\times}\">\\(M_1,M_2,B,\\delta_{\\times}\\)</span> 的同一实例；扩张转移与语言依该定义的 DFA 语义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}product\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\n\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\widehat\\delta_{M_1\\otimes_B M_2}((q_1,q_2),w)=(\\widehat\\delta_{M_1}(q_1,w),\\widehat\\delta_{M_2}(q_2,w))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}product\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\n\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\widehat\\delta_{M_1\\otimes_B M_2}((q_1,q_2),w)=(\\widehat\\delta_{M_1}(q_1,w),\\widehat\\delta_{M_2}(q_2,w))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}product\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\nL(M_1\\otimes_{B_{\\cap}}M_2)=L(M_1)\\cap L(M_2),\\quad L(M_1\\otimes_{B_{\\cup}}M_2)=L(M_1)\\cup L(M_2)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}product\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\nL(M_1\\otimes_{B_{\\cap}}M_2)=L(M_1)\\cap L(M_2),\\quad L(M_1\\otimes_{B_{\\cup}}M_2)=L(M_1)\\cup L(M_2)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}product\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\nL(M_1\\otimes_{B_{\\triangle}}M_2)=(L(M_1)\\setminus L(M_2))\\cup(L(M_2)\\setminus L(M_1))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}product\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\nL(M_1\\otimes_{B_{\\triangle}}M_2)=(L(M_1)\\setminus L(M_2))\\cup(L(M_2)\\setminus L(M_1))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>空词给出初态对。后继步把两个分量各更新一次，归纳得到运行不变式；将终态对代入三个接受集即得语言等式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-dfa-product","status":"resolved","id":"e1b2071b23104400","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dfa-product]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dfa-product","status":"resolved","id":"e1b2071b23104400","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[73-df-dfa-product]] 中 $M_1,M_2,B,\\delta_{\\times}$ 的同一实例；扩张转移与语言依该定义的 DFA 语义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M_1,M_2,B,\\delta_{\\times}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}product\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\n\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\widehat\\delta_{M_1\\otimes_B M_2}((q_1,q_2),w)=(\\widehat\\delta_{M_1}(q_1,w),\\widehat\\delta_{M_2}(q_2,w))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}product\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\nL(M_1\\otimes_{B_{\\cap}}M_2)=L(M_1)\\cap L(M_2),\\quad L(M_1\\otimes_{B_{\\cup}}M_2)=L(M_1)\\cup L(M_2)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}product\\text{-}correctness}\\vdash\nL(M_1\\otimes_{B_{\\triangle}}M_2)=(L(M_1)\\setminus L(M_2))\\cup(L(M_2)\\setminus L(M_1))","display":true}],"bytes":1772,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-63","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-dfa-product-correctness|乘积自动机的不变式]]"},{"id":"f5ad19f3a79bf5de","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)$、$N=(P,\\Sigma,\\eta,p_0,H)$ 为同一字母表上的 DFA；令 $n=|Q|,m=|P|$。语言语义、泵引理和乘积见 [[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]]、[[73-thm-finite-automaton-pumping]]、[[73-df-dfa-product]]、[[73-thm-dfa-product-correctness]]。"}],"outgoing":["e1b2071b23104400"]}